{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/28/5882049/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満面の笑みピースをみり愛と！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しそうな顔してる〜( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/28/5882049/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛は妹と同い年◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihaOOTD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はイヤリング〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/28/5882049/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青くて三角のイヤリングは\n今まで持ってなかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても合わせやすくて\nお気に入りなんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドメイドなので\n唯一無二なところもまた良き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてとても軽いよ！\n耳が痛くならないのは嬉しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして番外編。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の私のお気に入り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/28/5882049/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハリネズミちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくちゃんの側に座らせてみました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い。。\nフォルムが丸くて、\n愛おしくてたまらない。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PLAZAで見つけちゃいました。\nこの子可愛すぎる！！\nと衝撃を受けて即決でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家にいるときは大体\nハリネズミちゃん(ハリボゥちゃん)\nか、さくちゃんが側にいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「新宝島」サカナクションさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サカナクションさんの独特の雰囲気と\nクセになるリズムが大好き。\nスタイリッシュでカッコいい。\n\"次も その次も その次も まだ目的地じゃない\n夢の景色を探すんだ 宝島\"\n歌詞も深いなあ\n毎日苦戦しながらも夢を諦めずに\n追い続ける姿が目に浮かんでくる。\nまだまだ諦めたらいけないなと\n勇気ももらえる。\n新宝島。\nいつか見つかるかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお菓子総選挙のテレビを見ていたら\n無性にお菓子が食べたくなってしまった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお菓子食べたら負けだと思ったから\n父特製の親子丼を食べたよ。\n美味しかったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもきのこの山がランク外なのは\n少しショック..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はたけのこの里よりもきのこの山派なの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはどっち派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}